  m_text: "Folose\u0219te panoul de deasupra mesei ca s\u0103 alegi <b>profilul</b> \u0219i <b>nivelul</b>. \xCEl sim\u021Bi deja \xEEn m\xE2n\u0103.\nLa fiecare sta\u021Bie faci o \xEEncercare <color=#3AA6A0><b>f\u0103r\u0103 tremor</b></color> \u0219i una <color=#F26D5B><b>cu tremorul ales</b></color>."
